title: "Role of Spatial Coherence in Single-Shot Lensless Image Reconstruction: simulation and reconstruction code"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and reconstruction code for single-shot lensless imaging with
  partially coherent light, using a generalised van Cittert-Zernike and Schell
  propagation model.
